HST Office: File panel "In" and "Xuất" pages (two-sided printing, print preview, PDF, images and other formats, compress presentation).

Audit 13/11 (File panel): "In hai mặt" was only in the hidden HST menu and Alt+Q, and the panel had
no export to other formats. "Phiên bản trước" and "Thiết lập USB Token" are already on the Info
page (hst-backstage-previous-versions.patch).

- "In" (navprint) opens a page instead of running Print at once: In (.uno:Print, Ctrl+P still
  prints at once), Xem trước khi in (.uno:PrintPreview) and, in Writer, In hai mặt
  (org.hst.office.vi:ToggleDuplex of the bundled extension: the two-sided page layout of
  administrative documents; label and note Vietnamese in every UI language, as in the HST menu).
- "Xuất PDF" (navpdf) becomes "Xuất" with the export icon and opens a page: Xuất PDF
  (.uno:ExportToPDF), Xuất PDF ngay (.uno:ExportDirectToPDF), Ảnh và định dạng khác (.uno:ExportTo,
  the export dialog with PNG, JPEG, SVG, HTML...) and, in Slides, Nén bản trình chiếu
  (.uno:PresentationMinimizer).
- Each button has a one-line note; the page titles get the title font of the other pages
  (PAGE_TITLES); Tab into the page focuses its first button.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
